{
  "$comment": [
    "Hand-labelled ground truth for the bundled fixtures.",
    "",
    "Labels record what a careful human reading the page would write down, not",
    "what any particular extractor happens to produce. Where a page states more",
    "than one date, the label is the one an applicant must actually meet.",
    "",
    "'funder_accept' lists the surface forms that should count as correct, so a",
    "model answering 'NSF' is not marked wrong against 'National Science",
    "Foundation'. Grading identity, not string equality."
  ],
